As a junior sub-editor, we offer a starting salary of one hundred and fifty thousand Hong Kong dollars per annum.

186
00:10:09,720 --> 00:10:12,040
This doesn't include a generous housing allowance also.

187
00:10:12,640 --> 00:10:12,900
I understand.

188
00:10:13,780 --> 00:10:15,440
