195
00:10:44,040 --> 00:10:47,800
Alright so talking about salaries and remuneration packages.

196
00:10:47,800 --> 00:10:50,760
Now is this a common word to talk about remuneration?

197
00:10:51,060 --> 00:10:51,840
Yes it is.

198
00:10:52,060 --> 00:10:54,840
It basically means the way that you are paid for the work that you do.

199
00:10:55,260 --> 00:10:57,520
So remuneration, it sounds like a big long word.

200
00:10:58,300 --> 00:11:02,220
But in America I think we also just talk about salary or compensation.

201
00:11:03,320 --> 00:11:04,340
Compensation packages.

202
00:11:05,000 --> 00:11:11,800
Ok, so now when we talk about remuneration, we don't necessarily always talk about money like in this case, right?

203
00:11:11,800 --> 00:11:14,600
We can receive other benefits.

204
00:11:14,600 --> 00:11:14,750
That's right.

205
00:11:15,600 --> 00:11:21,000
And so a lot of times people think of the important parts of remuneration not just to be the salary but also to be the benefits.

206
00:11:21,000 --> 00:11:24,400
And so benefits are not the money, they are the other stuff.

207
00:11:24,400 --> 00:11:25,110
They're health care.

208
00:11:25,990 --> 00:11:32,290
We said earlier a housing allowance, even bonuses and things like that or education for your children.

209
00:11:32,550 --> 00:11:34,890
These are extras and these are a part of the package.

210
00:11:34,930 --> 00:11:36,230
Now what would you prefer?

211
00:11:36,230 --> 00:11:47,770
To have a good remuneration package like these other additional benefits with a low salary or would you prefer to have a high salary with not many of these benefits?

212
00:11:48,270 --> 00:11:57,270
Well I think that it's nice to get the benefits and a lower salary because often times at a company, like a big company, the company can get really good rates on health care.

213
00:11:57,810 --> 00:12:01,870
So if I have to pay for my health care with my big salary, maybe it will cost me more money.

214
00:12:02,250 --> 00:12:09,470
But if my company pays with the company rate, that means the amount that they pay, then maybe they can help me pay for these things much cheaper.

215
00:12:09,750 --> 00:12:11,150
And so in the end I make more money.

216
00:12:11,520 --> 00:12:12,520
Yeah.

217
00:12:12,520 --> 00:12:18,890
